tly requested.\\n- Added explicit warning exit messaging for default warning-only path (exit 6) and warnings-ok path (exit 0).\\n- Updated help/README docs and validate-exit-codes tests for new behavior.\\n- Verification: npm run build; npx vitest run tests/validate-exit-codes.test.ts (9/9 pass); npm test (173 files, 3615 passed, 3 skipped).\\n- Project-level validate currently fails for pre-existing meta/reference issues unrelated to this task (missing observations skill file, duplicate @observations slug refs).\",\n        \"supersedes\": null\n      }\n    ],\n    \"todos\": [],\n    \"automation\": \"eligible\",\n    \"_sourceFile\": \"/home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-spec-ui/.kspec/project.tasks.yaml\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"_ulid\": \"01KJS6ZTEGGSXT60KYK4YDRANY\",\n    \"slugs\": [],\n    \"title\": \"kspec validate --json appends human-readable summary text after JSON payload, causing invalid JSON f\",\n    \"type\": \"task\",\n    \"description\": \"kspec validate --json appends human-readable summary text after JSON payload, causing invalid JSON for downstream jq parsing. Expected: pure JSON when --json is set. Workaround: pipe through head or sed to strip trailing text. Reported from imgen project.\",\n    \"spec_ref\": null,\n    \"status\": \"completed\",\n    \"blocked_by\": [],\n    \"closed_reason\": \"Merged in PR #659. Implemented structured-output purity fix for validate/lint so --json/--yaml no longer appends human-readable post-result sections; added regression coverage in tests/validate-exit-codes.test.ts for parseable validate --json output and warnings-only messaging behavior. Notable: task has no spec_ref, so AC coverage is N/A; quality gates verified via PR checks and full npm test (173 files, 3616 passed, 3 skipped).\",\n    \"depends_on\": [],\n    \"context\": [],\n    \"priority\": 3,\n    \"tags\": [],\n    \"vcs_refs\": [],\n    \"session_id\": \"01KJVPPKAS8S5XY11KQ6CBTHT4\",\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-03-03T06:43:24.752Z\",\n    \"started_at\": \"2026-03-04T06:08:56.339Z\",\n    \"submitted_at\": \"2026-03-04T06:11:09.628Z\",\n    \"completed_at\": \"2026-03-04T07:05:06.027Z\",\n    \"notes\": [\n      {\n        \"_ulid\": \"01KJVQDEA47KER24GTNRA1GQ4S\",\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-03-04T06:08:57.157Z\",\n        \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\",\n        \"content\": \"Execution context:\\n- Background: validate --json must emit pure JSON for downstream parsers (jq, tooling).\\n- Scope: fix validate/lint structured output so no human text is appended to stdout in JSON mode; add regression tests.\\n- Files: src/cli/commands/validate.ts and validate-related tests.\\n- Verification: targeted validate tests plus full suite shard where feasible, and a direct validate --json parse check.\",\n        \"supersedes\": null\n      },\n      {\n        \"_ulid\": \"01KJVQGWKXMRRV3PWQV1VQS434\",\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-03-04T06:10:50.109Z\",\n        \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\",\n        \"content\": \"Implemented fix: validate/lint now suppress all post-result human-readable console output when structured output mode is active (--json/--yaml), preventing appended text on stdout. Added regression test in validate-exit-codes to assert validate --json stdout is parseable and contains no appended summary sections. Verified with npm run build and targeted vitest test file.\",\n        \"supersedes\": null\n      }\n    ],\n    \"todos\": [],\n    \"automation\": \"eligible\",\n    \"_sourceFile\": \"/home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-spec-ui/.kspec/project.tasks.yaml\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"_ulid\": \"01KJS6ZW51AVVEKHSP2J0AWXHY\",\n    \"slugs\": [],\n    \"title\": \"kspec batch --commands '' hangs instead of erroring — empty/missing args should fail fast with a cle\",\n    \"type\": \"task\",\n    \"description\": \"kspec batch --commands '' hangs instead of erroring — empty/missing args should fail fast with a clear error, not block on stdin. Discovered when ralph loop got stuck calling batch with empty string ar