behavior exiting with code 1 (EXIT_CODES.ERROR).\\n- Updated tests/ralph-replacement.test.ts to assert explicit exit code 1 and verify the new mapping line.\\nVerification:\\n- npx vitest run tests/ralph-replacement.test.ts (pass: 9 tests)\\n- npx vitest run (pass: 173 files, 3641 passed, 3 skipped)\\n- kspec validate exits 4 due pre-existing project-wide meta/reference issues unrelated to this task (missing .kspec/skills/observations/SKILL.md and duplicate @observations slug).\",\n        \"supersedes\": null\n      },\n      {\n        \"_ulid\": \"01KJW862RND6TRHHJ90R4FV9SR\",\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-03-04T11:02:01.749Z\",\n        \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\",\n        \"content\": \"Submitted for review in PR #670: https://github.com/kynetic-ai/kynetic-spec/pull/670\",\n        \"supersedes\": null\n      },\n      {\n        \"_ulid\": \"01KJW8G3K2BQ44P56636NPYRJ6\",\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-03-04T11:07:30.274Z\",\n        \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\",\n        \"content\": \"[FIX_CYCLE: 1] Review findings: MUST-FIX: @ralph-replacement ac-1 regression in PR #670; deprecation message and tests removed required dry-run migration mapping.\",\n        \"supersedes\": null\n      },\n      {\n        \"_ulid\": \"01KJW93QVKPK8CQX2V190EMN60\",\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-03-04T11:18:13.619Z\",\n        \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\",\n        \"content\": \"[FIX_CYCLE: 1] Restored dry-run migration guidance required by @ralph-replacement ac-1.\\n- Added deprecation mapping: 'kspec ralph --dry-run' -> 'kspec agent dispatch start --dry-run' in src/cli/commands/ralph.ts.\\n- Updated tests/ralph-replacement.test.ts to assert dry-run mapping is present (using resilient substring assertions to avoid ANSI formatting brittleness).\\nVerification:\\n- npm run build (pass)\\n- npx vitest run tests/ralph-replacement.test.ts (pass: 9/9)\\n- npx vitest run (pass: 173 files, 3641 passed, 3 skipped)\\n- kspec validate exits 4 due pre-existing project-wide schema/r