\"task\",\n    \"description\": \"tests/cli-serve.test.ts has 1 test failure when run in shard 3 (71s duration, likely timeout). Need to investigate whether it is a daemon port conflict or timing issue in parallel shard execution. The test takes 71s which suggests it may be waiting on a timeout.\",\n    \"spec_ref\": \"@cli-serve-commands\",\n    \"meta_ref\": null,\n    \"plan_ref\": null,\n    \"status\": \"completed\",\n    \"blocked_by\": [],\n    \"closed_reason\": \"Already implemented on main in PR #658 (merge commit bae6c34ea; implementation commit 50d2dff86) via @task-cli-serve-daemon-isolation. Verified by rerunning shard-3 test suite and two additional shard-3 runs; cli-serve.test.ts remained stable with no failures.\",\n    \"depends_on\": [],\n    \"context\": [],\n    \"priority\": 3,\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"testing\",\n      \"bug\",\n      \"cli\"\n    ],\n    \"vcs_refs\": [],\n    \"session_id\": \"01KJWERJSFT0HYB45VHW82PX7B\",\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-03-03T19:03:11.504Z\",\n    \"started_at\": \"2026-03-04T13:02:35.669Z\",\n    \"completed_at\": \"2026-03-04T13:02:37.406Z\",\n    \"notes\": [\n      {\n        \"_ulid\": \"01KJTPG8KNPTW4X1SEAQNJN5ZW\",\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-03-03T20:33:46.613Z\",\n        \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\",\n        \"content\": \"Automation status set to needs_review: Missing spec_ref; add/attach spec with AC coverage before automation\",\n        \"supersedes\": null\n      },\n      {\n        \"_ulid\": \"01KJWF2VRW8YTV3N0AZ4M423MP\",\n        \"created_at\": \"2026-03-04T13:02:36.317Z\",\n        \"author\": \"Jacob Chapel\",\n        \"content\": \"Execution context:\\n- Scope: verify and fix shard-3 cli-serve flakiness if still reproducible.\\n- Verification: npm run test:shard3; npx vitest run --shard=3/3 (twice).\\n- Outcome: no cli-serve failures reproduced; tests/cli-serve.test.ts passed consistently (~66s per run).\\n- Existing fix identified: merged PR #658 (commit bae6c34ea) from task @task